# Don't download 4K videos; it's too hard to decode for our CPU.
# Besides, we don't have a 4K monitor, and 1920x1080 is enough for our needs.
--format='best[height<=1080]'

# To suppress this warning:
#
#     WARNING: [youtube] No supported JavaScript runtime could be found.
#     Only deno is enabled by default; to use another runtime add
#     --js-runtimes RUNTIME[:PATH]  to your command/config.
#     YouTube extraction without a JS runtime has been deprecated,
#     and some formats may be missing.
#     See  https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/wiki/EJS  for details on installing one
--js-runtimes node:/usr/bin/node
